{
 "about": [
  "Which state a bot is in (PROTOCOL.md, \"What a bot is doing now\", `bots.state`): the box's rule, `botState` and `botNow` in box/src/link/lists/rule.ts,",
  "which box/test/bot-states.test.ts holds to these. `counts` is what its sessions come to (`expect.bots` in session-lists.json: at work, waiting",
  "on you, thinking, blocked, and `unseen`, when the newest turn you haven't read ended), `rest` its `paused` and next wake-up (`wakes`, seconds), `at`",
  "now (ms) and `before` what the box last said of it. `expect.now` is its `now` in `kuvo/bots`: the first state that holds of needsYou, blocked,",
  "thinking (every one at work thinks), working, done, asleep (paused, or its next wake-up more than 12 hours away) and idle, and since when (`at`",
  "for a state new since `before`, `before`'s for the same, and for done when the turn ended). `expect.turns`: when its state changes with nothing",
  "else changing (its next wake-up comes within 12 hours, ms), else null. A client adds `offline` itself; it works none of this out."
 ],
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "nothing at work, waiting, blocked or unread, no wake-up: idle",
   "counts": {
    "working": 0,
    "asking": 0
   },
   "rest": {
    "paused": false
   },
   "at": 1800000000000,
   "expect": {
    "now": {
     "working": 0,
     "asking": 0,
     "state": "idle",
     "since": 1800000000000
    },
    "turns": null
   }
  },
  {
   "name": "one waiting on you comes first, whatever else its sessions do",
   "counts": {
    "working": 2,
    "asking": 1,
    "thinking": 2,
    "blocked": 1,
    "blockedBy": "limit",
    "unseen": 950
   },
   "rest": {
    "paused": true
   },
   "at": 1800000000000,
   "expect": {
    "now": {
     "working": 2,
     "asking": 1,
     "thinking": 2,
     "blocked": 1,
     "blockedBy": "limit",
     "state": "needsYou",
     "since": 1800000000000
    },
    "turns": null
   }
  },
